  <item>
    <title>【欣耿啥呢EP.6】高考回忆录：在高三的时候得了三高。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68b05a8f5faf368659e32a73</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68b05a8f5faf368659e32a73</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 28 Aug 2025 13:45:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨，又是好久不见咯，这里是《欣耿啥呢》EP.6。</span></p><span></span><p><span>其实也就一个月啦。</span></p><span></span><p><span>总之我们终于在大学开学之前，聊了聊我们的高三一年。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一年有很多值得感谢和辱骂的瞬间，而一切都已经过去。尘埃落定后又会有多少思考，还会有多少怀念？我们也不知道，于是打开麦克，敞开聊一聊。</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果一定要我一句话总结高三一年，其实应该是：不必追求绝对的公正“好”和“不好”在当下早已没有定论，“客观公允”不是时刻存在， “我喜欢”就是天大的事。开始自我认同，也算某种进步吧。</span></p><span></span><p><span>图片是耿高中的毕业典礼。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhUposALsPUaT_ksBIgZouorQUyQ.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内含：回忆往事，追忆故人，展望未来，刻薄艺考。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>废话少说，欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="47">00:00:47</a> 又是好久不见！怎么就快开学了啊！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="88">00:01:28</a> 汇报近况：两位也都还活着</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="557">00:09:17</a> 还是有好事可以宣布的：片子拿入围啦</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1157">00:19:17</a> 关于艺考的高三血泪，建议快跑</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1614">00:26:54</a> 小周总的线下面试奇闻</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2223">00:37:03</a> 艺考两年的体悟是"先放弃审判自己"</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2331">00:38:51</a> 一个熬过三年高中的致谢and辱骂名单（内含吹捧以及刻薄）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2611">00:43:31</a> 艺考中我们要如何书写痛苦？为什么决心不再复读？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2773">00:46:13</a> “我没有力气再诉说一遍我的热爱”：对行业和世界也算有点新的体悟了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3377">00:56:17</a> 小周总的致谢名单（并非纯粹致谢）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3617">01:00:17</a> 对之后可能要艺考的朋友们带来殷切嘱托</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3728">01:02:08</a> 感谢收听！想去哪就去哪吧！自由万岁！</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：耿耿</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：New Soul - Yeel Naim</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：去哪 - 阿肆Asi</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/671fdf37bc9c336f46211072/lqGFZ-I1CdwWVgQ4rwmXxz7314xC.m4a" length="63597683" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:05:28</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkPCg2KuoZ5j0PBXNUjlfvs0_95d.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>【欣耿啥呢EP.5】聊《小白船》：十五岁正是爱的好年纪。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/687924a9a12f9ff06ab2f3b7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">687924a9a12f9ff06ab2f3b7</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 16:42:06 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨嗨，真的好久不见，这里是《欣耿啥呢》EP.5。</span></p><span></span><p><span>漫长的高考结束之后，我们回来啦！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一期相距4360km艰难制作的节目，此刻某耿正在新疆的草原写下这段导览，关于电影《小白船》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这是一部从制作参展到如今公映的时间贯穿了主播们高中三年的影片。这部影片到底讲了什么故事？它值得一看吗？它为什么让某耿发癫，又为什么让小周总重拳出击？以上疑问也许会在这期节目中得到一些解答。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期封面中的帆船是某耿昨天在赛里木湖拍到的，是一艘小白船。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fr32MKwRV117gz3S_FJq9vZFllj1.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>本期内含：影片评评，cp 磕磕，创作展望，以及一些对比观影。</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>废话少说，欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:00:28</a> &nbsp;好久不见！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="65">00:01:05</a> 《小白船》和它漫长的季节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="155">00:02:35</a> &nbsp;两年了，两位主播终于要吵架了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="178">00:02:58</a> &nbsp;淡淡的东三省，淡淡的夏天，淡淡的故事，淡淡嘟～</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="527">00:08:47</a> &nbsp;看到猴子想到《疯狂的外星人》是人类的本能</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="762">00:12:42</a> &nbsp;某耿夸夸摄影</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1299">00:21:39</a> &nbsp;某耿磕疯了</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1444">00:24:04</a> &nbsp;消失的吻戏</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1810">00:30:10</a> &nbsp;好荒唐</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2074">00:34:34</a> &nbsp;摄影佬又在电影里关注什么东西</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2872">00:47:52</a> &nbsp;滑冰吧，去滑冰吧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3133">00:52:13</a> &nbsp;另一种结尾</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3886">01:04:46</a> &nbsp;对比《花漾少女杀人事件》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4258">01:10:58</a> &nbsp;《左耳》？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4345">01:12:25</a> &nbsp;一些回朔和展望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4508">01:15:08</a> &nbsp;拜拜！</span></p><span></span><p><span>剪辑：小周总</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：New Soul - Yeel Naim</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：纸黏土 - 魏如萱Waa</span></p>]]></description>
