  <item>
    <title>【欣耿啥呢EP.4】聊《想飞的女孩》：有人想飞，有人想死。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67cc517f0766616acd8758a7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67cc517f0766616acd8758a7</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 08 Mar 2025 15:12:14 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨各位好，好久不见，这里是欣耿啥呢。</span></p><span></span><p><span>（导览部分由某耿完成。）</span></p><span></span><p><span>为什么要强调一句呢？因为本期正片由小周总一人录制，关于前段时间风声大大的《想飞的女孩》进行一些评评。</span></p><span></span><p><span>小周总本来想胁迫我进行观影后共同辱骂，但由于某耿很不幸最近患上电影艺术恐惧症候群，只能作罢。看不得电影的症状预计大概会在6月10号完全好转，期待回归啊期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span>好啦，废话少说，开始开始。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期时间线↓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a>：妇女节快乐呀</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="80">01:20</a>：该死的剧情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="230">03:50</a>: &nbsp;&nbsp;一些场外的搞笑信息</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="332">05:32</a>：start</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="929">15:29</a>：让台湾人说重庆话是。。。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1125">18:45</a>：第一段令人难以下咽的麦麸</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1200">20:00</a>：好吧第二段卖的还行</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1343">22:23</a>：无畏的希望</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1650">27:30</a>：“她俩为啥不报警啊”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1685">28:05</a>: &nbsp;&nbsp;就纯想飞呗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1772">29:32</a>：恶毒的总结</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2171">36:11</a>: &nbsp;&nbsp;美好的祝愿</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期不包含片头片尾曲目。（喂！不加片头片尾一看就不是某耿的风格！控诉！）</span></p>]]></description>
