  <item>
    <title>【欣耿啥呢EP.3】年终总结：三个和尚没水喝，因为都在胡扯。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/679f554fd74435e4a3c4f255</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">679f554fd74435e4a3c4f255</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 02 Feb 2025 11:27:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>哈喽！又是好久不见，先来一句迟到的新年快乐！给各位拜年啦！今天是初五，记得迎财神！蛇年肆巳如意！</span></p><span></span><p><span>首先小周总回归，热烈鼓掌！在辞旧迎新之际，两位主理和已经成为常驻嘉宾的小武进行了一下年度盘点，关于今年看过的影片剧集游戏和经历过的事情等等等等，炖了一份杂烩上桌。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内含：影片安利，剧集分项，群口相声，旧年回顾新年展望，以及一些春节档恶毒拉踩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>废话少说，欢迎食用。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期时间轴↓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">00:01:32</a> 导师的任务罢了：“过年你们录一期博客呗。”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="136">00:02:16</a> 主题选择风波（顺便拉踩一下近五年来最无聊春节档）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="223">00:03:43</a> 周总2024院线第一名：《朱同在三年级失去了超能力》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（对恶俗段子的深思）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="740">00:12:20</a> 某耿由霍格沃兹之遗到中国神话：聊聊IP那些事</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（狠狠拉踩哪吒和封神是干什么）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1304">00:21:44</a> 小武的韩剧赛道和院线安利：《没关系，是爱情啊》＋《年少日记》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（青少年心理健康守护者）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1769">00:29:29</a> 周总关于爱与性的思考：《阿诺拉》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（《某种物质》《可怜的东西》《小小的我》大对比）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2879">00:47:59</a> 某耿岩井俊二全肯定：《关于莉莉周的一切》＋《四月物语》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3095">00:51:35</a> 小武的台剧安利：《影后》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（讨论：大女主人设对女性角色的束缚）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3389">00:56:29</a> 周总和Newjeans的起源：《梦之歌》</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（梦核感的正确打开方式）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3818">01:03:38</a> 三位主播的个人向年度总结（内含对DeepSeek的殷切期盼）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4157">01:09:17</a> 结尾：祝大家蛇年顺意！！下期再见！！</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：new soul - yeel Naim</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：小船 - 163 braces</span></p>]]></description>
