    <guid isPermaLink="false">676927b51e823e72d30e2d26</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 23 Dec 2024 11:53:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>嗨嗨，好久不见，这里是《欣耿啥呢》EP.2</span></p><span></span><p><span>小周总不在，耿某称大王。于是邀请了一位特邀嘉宾，同时也是我的好朋友小武，我们一起聊了聊最近看过路演的一部新上映影片：《最后的告别》。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期内含：影片评评，视听分析，市场展望，以及一些缺德拉踩。</span></p><span></span><p><span>废话少说，欢迎收听。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>本期时间轴 ↓</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="62">00:01:02</a> &nbsp;托更太久忏悔一下</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="81">00:01:21</a> &nbsp;进入主题：关于电影《最后的告别》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="211">00:03:31</a> &nbsp;看完后的第一感受？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="443">00:07:23</a> &nbsp;印象最深的镜头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="711">00:11:51</a> &nbsp;对比《河边的错误》：差别？优劣？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1209">00:20:09</a> &nbsp;岩井俊二激推发言：关于对电影的敬畏之心</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1427">00:23:47</a> &nbsp;影片中意象的运用：表，牛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1758">00:29:18</a> &nbsp;耿某小故事：姥爷的牛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1911">00:31:51</a> &nbsp;更多意象解读：昆虫，火焰，母亲，餐桌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2215">00:36:55</a> &nbsp;精神病和读书人：片中父亲的诗如何解读？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2701">00:45:01</a> &nbsp;小武小故事：乡土中国</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2824">00:47:04</a> &nbsp;关于女主的疑问</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3110">00:51:50</a> &nbsp;斗胆聊一下：艺术电影的出路在哪？（内含一些邵艺辉）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3507">00:58:27</a> &nbsp;片尾！（下期再见！）</span></p><span></span><p><span>片头曲：new soul - yeel Naim</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：年月漫漫 - 电影《年少日记》主题曲</span></p>]]></description>
