  <item>
    <title>【欣耿啥呢EP.1 】聊点《再见爱人》：没爱人怎么再见爱人！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67209dfd1d2e86f67ac786f3</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67209dfd1d2e86f67ac786f3</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 29 Oct 2024 08:54:10 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一期稍显（极其）刻薄的试水EP.1</span></p><span></span><p><span>老带新观看《再见爱人》？</span></p><span></span><p><span>俩未婚未育高中生如何看待亲密关系？</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎收听，不建议心梗。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>本期内服：</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="64">01:04</a> &lt;欣耿啥呢&gt;名字怎么来的？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="146">02:26</a> 路人VS粉丝 怎么看待这档离婚综艺</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="461">07:41</a> 最共情的一对：李行亮and麦麦</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;一对母子？母亲身份对麦麦的禁锢？情绪先行还是事情先行？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1744">29:04</a> 谁管钱重要吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2057">34:17</a> 丝滑转折之有的人我们无法共情：黄圣依＆杨子</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;大骂一些爹味与控制欲；关系转变的契机；</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2478">41:18</a> &nbsp;他们也许是某种play。（能播吧）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2629">43:49</a> 杨子社会地位认同：“你姓什么”</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;霸总杨子会梦见晋江文学吗</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3012">50:12</a> &nbsp;刻薄主播无法共情真正的刻薄：葛夕＆刘爽</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;“你凭什么搞颜值打分？”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3512">58:32</a> 更在意物质还是更在意态度？</span></p><span></span><p><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;（三百万怎么做到全亏完的）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3769">1:02:49</a> 这三对之间还有爱吗？那恨呢？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3833">1:03:53</a> &nbsp;大胆假设：杨子可能看不起所有人（主播的一些八卦和蛐蛐）</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4613">1:16:53</a> &nbsp;预测一下结局：HE 还是 BE</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4992">1:23:12</a> &nbsp;END part</span></p><span></span><p><span>分手快乐~祝你快乐~</span></p>]]></description>
